@startuml
participant Alice
participant "Bob Server" as Bob
note left of Alice: ready to greet
Alice -> Bob: Hello Bob
note over Alice, Bob: handshake
Bob --> Alice: Hi Alice
loop retry
Alice -> Bob: How are you?
alt happy
Bob --> Alice: Great thanks
else busy
Bob --> Alice: later
end
end
opt farewell
Alice -> Bob: bye
end
@enduml
